# Simple 3D Pyramid in Wavefront OBJ format
# 5 Vertices, 5 Normals, 6 Triangles (Faces)

# --- 1. Vertices (v) ---
# Format: v X Y Z
v  0.0  1.0  0.0    # 1: Top Peak
v -1.0  0.0  1.0    # 2: Front-Left Base
v  1.0  0.0  1.0    # 3: Front-Right Base
v  1.0  0.0 -1.0    # 4: Back-Right Base
v -1.0  0.0 -1.0    # 5: Back-Left Base

# --- 2. Vertex Textures (vt) ---
# Format: vt U V
# vt 0.5 1.0   # 1: Top Peak Texture Coordinate
# vt 0.0 0.0   # 2: Front-Left Base Texture Coordinate

# --- 2. Vertex Normals (vn) ---
# Format: vn X Y Z
vn  0.000  0.707  0.707   # 1: Front Face Normal
vn  0.707  0.707  0.000   # 2: Right Face Normal
vn  0.000  0.707 -0.707   # 3: Back Face Normal
vn -0.707  0.707  0.000   # 4: Left Face Normal
vn  0.000 -1.000  0.000   # 5: Bottom Face Normal (Pointing straight down)

# --- 3. Faces (f) ---
# Format: f vertex_index/vertex_texture_index/vertex_normal_index | 
#         f vertex_index/vertex_texture_index 
#         f vertex_index
#         f vertex_index//vertex_normal_index 
# Front Face
f 1//1 2//1 3//1
# Right Face
f 1//2 3//2 4//2
# Back Face
f 1//3 4//3 5//3
# Left Face
f 1//4 5//4 2//4
# Bottom Face (Requires two triangles to make the square base)
f 2//5 5//5 4//5
f 2//5 4//5 3//5